; Five documents, five arm diagnostics, none of them the union code. Each
; is exactly what the bare kind would have said in that slot.
;
; The vector row is the same rule one level down: the vector is the only
; alternative a vector can reach, so it is the determined arm and its
; `element_at` failure is reported at the slot, framed the way a direct
; vector slot is framed — same span, path and code on both walkers.
(diagnostics
  (diagnostic :code repr_out_of_range :path [k value])
  (diagnostic :code not_member        :path [k ease])
  (diagnostic :code not_head_member   :path [k ease])
  (diagnostic :code repr_out_of_range :path [k value])
  (diagnostic :code not_head_member   :path [k three]))
